---
// Quiz figure for Post 5: Ex-date calendar around GDKHQ & Record Date.
---
<div class="qfig-sbq05ex">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 185" role="img" aria-label="Ex-date calendar showing Tuesday as last cum-dividend session, Wednesday as Ex-Date (GDKHQ) where price adjusts and new buys get no right, and Thursday as Record Date (DKCC).">
    <text x="16" y="24" class="qfig-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>HOSE cash dividend calendar: 15% par (1,500 đ/CP)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lịch chốt cổ tức tiền 15% mệnh giá (1.500 đ/CP)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="16" y="46" width="166" height="118" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="99" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Tue (Cum-date)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ Ba (Trước chốt)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="99" y="106" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Close: 50,000 đ</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa: 50.000 đ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="99" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Buys get dividend</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mua hôm nay có quyền</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="206" y="46" width="168" height="118" rx="8" class="qfig-card-red" />
    <text x="290" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Wed (GDKHQ / Ex)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ Tư (Ngày GDKHQ)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="290" y="106" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Ref adjusts at 09:00</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tham chiếu hạ lúc 09:00</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="290" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-red">
      <tspan data-lang-en>New buys: NO right</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mua mới: KHÔNG quyền</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="398" y="46" width="166" height="118" rx="8" class="qfig-card" />
    <text x="481" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Thu (ĐKCC / Record)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ Năm (Chốt ĐKCC)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="481" y="106" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>VSDC locks list</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>VSDC chốt danh sách</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="481" y="136" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Paid ~3 weeks later</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền về sau ~3 tuần</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-sbq05ex { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-sbq05ex svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-sbq05ex text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-sbq05ex .qfig-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
